  "body": "An elevated north-facing coastal pair in one of Rothesay Bay's most desirable residential pockets.\r\n\r\n22 & 24 Beechwood Road offer approximately 2,024sqm of freehold THAB-zoned land with sea outlook, strong school zoning and the flexibility to be considered as a standalone development opportunity or as part of a larger five-site development platform.\r\n\r\nFor developers seeking a more manageable entry point in the current market, this is a rare chance to secure scale without necessarily committing to the full broader project from day one.\r\n\r\n* Two freehold titles, approx. 2,024sqm combined\r\n* Residential - Terrace Housing and Apartment Building Zone\r\n* Elevated north-facing site with coastal outlook\r\n* Approx. 45.3m frontage to Beechwood Road\r\n* Can be assessed as a standalone development site\r\n* Can also be combined with 16, 18 & 20 Browns Bay Road\r\n* Part of a broader five-site platform with RC/BC for 35 townhouses\r\n* A more manageable entry point for developers cautious about larger projects\r\n\r\nContact Ray 022 158 3320 today for a comprehensive information pack or to arrange a private site inspection.",
